From a274756d20995fa7ddc4b9dd7eca8b7d046c5105 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 17:53:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Task 14: larger input waists, intracavity thermo-optic
 modulation, 100 ms limits

Task 11 cells (5-20 mm), 30 layouts, 3.3 and 1.53 um. Waists 75-400 um with
the launch area scaled to the input facet; modulation of the slab index in the
inclusions, 75 um spots, a half-area zone or the whole membrane (first-order
phase k0 delta l per route, exact J0 time average). Inclusion modulation is
ineffective; membrane modulation at delta 1e-4 (+-9 K) cuts the static fringe
10x without smearing the line. 100 ms limits against the dither averaging
and the laser power. REPORT section 6i.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NLfEqncaEw1RGMDLUGdFgb
